    "Your first step beyond the vanilla furnace. Craft with eight iron ingots around a regular furnace in a 3×3 ring.",
    "",
    "Smelts in 160 ticks (vanilla is 200) and can store Forge Energy for augments and generator mode. Tier 0 furnace — the foundation every higher tier builds on.",
    "",
    "Right-click to open the GUI. Sneak + right-click with an upgrade item to skip crafting the next tier in place.",
  ],
