  "quest.29BEA343E40E6C84.quest_desc": [
    "High-tier smelting: diamonds in the corners, glass on the sides, gold furnace in the center.",
    "",
    "80-tick cook time, tier 2 energy storage, and 240 RF/tick when running as a generator. One of the best all-round furnaces before emerald specialization.",
    "",
    "Upgrade from gold with the Gold to Diamond upgrade, or craft fresh when your random block finally drops diamonds.",
